        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the depths of the mountain, carve your own tunnels as you dig deeper. Move at your own pace and listen to your instincts while you dig for hidden riches. Bring <strong>treasures</strong> to the surface and enhance your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain’s belly is vast, dig wherever you please. If your intuition guides you well, you’ll discover countless enigmatic <strong>chambers</strong>, <strong>corridors</strong>, and <strong>halls</strong> filled with riches. Once you’ve gained enough experience and gold, you’ll be able to purchase powerful tools. With these tools, you’ll finally be able to solve the mountain’s greatest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now grab your pickaxe and dig, dig, dig your way into the <strong>forgotten</strong> <strong>CAVE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.poster.avif?t=1763565592\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.webm?t=1763565592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.mp4?t=1763565592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the depths of the mountain, carve your own tunnels as you dig deeper. Move at your own pace and listen to your instincts while you dig for hidden riches. Bring <strong>treasures</strong> to the surface and enhance your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain’s belly is vast, dig wherever you please. If your intuition guides you well, you’ll discover countless enigmatic <strong>chambers</strong>, <strong>corridors</strong>, and <strong>halls</strong> filled with riches. Once you’ve gained enough experience and gold, you’ll be able to purchase powerful tools. With these tools, you’ll finally be able to solve the mountain’s greatest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now grab your pickaxe and dig, dig, dig your way into the <strong>forgotten</strong> <strong>CAVE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.poster.avif?t=1763565592\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.webm?t=1763565592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628580/extras/0c19b24001267d1d7142c35586837308.mp4?t=1763565592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Dig deep, unearth treasures. Upgrade your tools to uncover the secrets of the mystical caves. This is also an inner journey of relaxation, where your intuition can guide you as you dig deeper into the mysteries.",
